Subject: [PATCH] android: backport BinderFS from Google's Android 4.19 tree

Import the Binder implementation and UAPI from kernel/msm commit
500b3a2059c1eec0fec08ec56add06320ea901a8 (android14-qpr3). The associated
credential-hook and pollfree backports follow in this series.

Source: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/msm/+/500b3a2059c1eec0fec08ec56add06320ea901a8/drivers/android/

